BlackCab is your driver service for fast, reliable, and accessible rides anytime. You can travel anywhere you want around Bucharest without needing rental car services or wasting your time figuring out bus routes. Our professional drivers will drive you safely right to your destination.

Need to pick up a friend along the way or to drop off your loved ones before heading home? With BlackCab it's easier than ever to quickly make a stop or change the route during your ride.

Why choose BackCab instead of conventional taxi services? 
- Transparent fees - you’ll always know in advance how much your ride costs;
- High-quality, reliable and trustworthy riding service;
- GPS centralised system that allows you to track the driver’s arrival in the app;
- Select, comfortable, and safe vehicles;
- Polite and well-dressed English speaking drivers;
- Ability to book your ride in advance;
- Multiple booking options: mobile app, phone, website;
- Possibility to pay by cash, POS or credit card;
- Wide selection of cars available (premium, luxury, and even economy services).

Whether you are using BlackCab for a ride across town, to go to the airport, to an important business meeting, at a concert, movie or restaurant, there is always a black car for every occasion. Book now your cab and enjoy an affordable, welcoming and memorable ride!

Don’t miss upcoming promotions, discounts and new app features – subscribe to our newsletter and follow us on: 
Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/TheBlackCab/
Instagram - https://instagram.com/theblackcab.romania
Twitter - https://twitter.com/blackcabromania

Удобный интерфейс приложения поможет легко оформить заказ и получить нужную информацию пользователям всех возрастов и в любых ситуациях.

Избавьтесь навсегда от траты времени на объяснения, откуда Вас забрать и куда доставить. Просто используйте один из подходящих сейчас вариантов:
- выбор адреса из встроенного каталога;
- поиск адреса по Google Maps и Яндекс.Картам;
- заказ на точку на карте.

Оперативно получайте важную информацию по своему заказу на экране смартфона:
- расстояние от адреса подачи до места назначения по транспортной сети; 
- предварительная стоимость заказа;
- текущий статус заказа;
- данные по назначенному автомобилю;
- итоговый чек поездки.

При необходимости используйте возможность связи с водителем прямо из приложения. 

Мы дорожим Вашим выбором и стремимся повысить Ваш комфорт при пользовании услугами нашего такси. Попробуйте мобильное приложение для вызова такси и убедитесь, что каждое наше взаимодействие станет для Вас еще удобнее и приятнее.

The new Cris Taxi Bucuresti app offers:
- order a taxi with just two taps;
- the opportunity of calculating the trip’s route and estimated cost, having entered the destination;
- the possibility of ordering a taxi without gps tracking, using the address search engine;
- showing points of interest around the location;
- details about the driver and the taxi vehicle;
- the possibility to communicate by phone with the driver or with the taxi dispatcher;
- client-driver messages;
Cris Taxi Bucharest is proud of a bright and long tradition in the field of passenger transport (taxi) since 1992.
Our taxi services fully cover both Bucharest and the surrounding areas.
Cris Taxi Bucharest has a fleet of 1000 cars (Skoda Octavia, Renault Clio, Dacia Logan).
Among the services offered by CrisTaxi Bucharest you will find a modern taxi dispatcher, based on online and telephone orders

GAL trans is a Moldovan carrier company that operates regular bus services from Moldova to Romania, Ukraine and Russia.

With the application from GAL Trans you can easily:
– choose a flight suitable for the requested date;
– check buses routes on the map;
– see buses’ photos;
– make a reservation with payment to the driver during the boarding;
– pay for the ticket online;
– get access to the history of all purchased tickets in the personal account
– make a quick ticket return in your personal account
– request information from support service.

GAL Trans has a large bus fleet that meets European standards.

The professional drivers team will make sure that your trip is as comfortable as possible.

GAL Trans - it's important, who you travel with!

The new TaxiClub application will help you book a taxi all over Moldova. A user-friendly application interface will help you easily place an order. It is designed for users of all ages to help them get the right information in any kind of situations. Get rid of the waste of time for explanations, where to meet you and where the destination point is. Just use one of the currently available options:
- address selection from the built-in catalog;
- search for the address on the Google Maps or/and Yandex Maps;
- book a car by pointing on the map.
Get permanent updates regarding  your order on the smartphone screen:
- distance from the start address to the destination point;
- the preliminary cost of the order;
- current status of the order;
- data on the assigned car;
- final check of the trip.
If necessary, use the option to communicate with the driver directly from the application.
Your choice is important for us, so we strive to improve your comfort when using our taxi services. Try the mobile application to call a taxi and make sure each of our interactions will become even more convenient and pleasant.
